    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Job application form",
        "level": 1,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Thank you for your interest in working with us. Please read these notes before you fill in the form. We shortlist only from what you tell us on it, so take your time and give us the full picture.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Filling in the form",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
        "type": "bullet_list",
        "items": [
          "Answer every question. If a question does not apply to you, write \"not applicable\".",
          "We do not accept CVs in place of this form, but you may attach one as well.",
          "Fill in the form yourself. If you need help, or the form in another format, contact the recruitment team using the details in the job advert.",
          "Send your application by the closing date in the advert. We cannot consider late applications."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Your supporting statement",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The supporting statement in section 7 is the most important part of the form. The person specification for the job lists what someone needs to do it well. For each point, tell us how you meet it, with an example from your work, studies, volunteering or life outside work. Say what you did, how you did it and what happened as a result. Experience from any part of your life counts.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "What happens next",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "A panel compares each application with the person specification and invites the closest matches to interview. We will tell you whether you have been shortlisted. Any offer we make depends on satisfactory references, proof of your right to work in the UK and, where the job needs it, a criminal record check.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Equal opportunities",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We welcome applications from everyone. A separate equality monitoring form comes with this application. It is optional, it is kept apart from your application, and the people who shortlist and interview never see it. We do not ask your age, marital status or other personal circumstances on this form, because they play no part in our decision.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "How we use your information: we use the information on this form only to assess your application and, if you are successful, to set up your employment. It is seen by the recruitment team and the shortlisting and interview panel. If you are not successful we keep it only for the period our recruitment privacy notice sets, and then delete it.",
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "How we use your information:",
            "bold": true
          },
          {
            "text": " we use the information on this form only to assess your application and, if you are successful, to set up your employment. It is seen by the recruitment team and the shortlisting and interview panel. If you are not successful we keep it only for the period our recruitment privacy notice sets, and then delete it."
          }
        ],
        "alignment": "left"
      },
