        "id": "0c110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "You do not need to tell us about convictions, cautions, reprimands or final warnings that are spent under the Rehabilitation of Offenders Act 1974, unless the job advert says the job needs a standard or enhanced criminal record check. Having a criminal record will not necessarily stop you getting the job. We consider each case fairly, taking into account the offence, when it happened and its relevance to the job.",
